error: `==` compares the values, and `Node` is not `Equatable`
  `==` looks at what two `shared` values point to; `same` tells whether they point to one object
  --> error_shared_not_equatable.sg:8:11
 8 |     print(a == b)
   |           ^^^^^^
  hint: `same(a, b)`, or add `Equatable` to the definition: `Node : Equatable`
